## Nada
Nada-nada = The command was executed successfully. { $args }
Nada-deco_helper = This command is used for testing.
Nada-deco_usage = How to use: { $prefix }nada (text)
Nada-deco_description = This command is used for testing.

## Restart
Restart-unexpected_error = There was an error restarting the bot: { $exception }
Restart-deco_helper = Restarts the bot.
Restart-deco_usage = To use: { $prefix }restart
Restart-deco_description = Restarts the bot.

## Reload
Reload-commands_reloaded = The commands were successfully reloaded.
Reload-command_not_found = Command with name { $command } not found.
Reload-command_reloaded = Command { $command } successfully reloaded.
Reload-command_reloaded_error = Command { $attr } had an error while reloading: { $exception }
Reload-module_reloaded = { $attr } were successfully reloaded.
Reload-module_reloaded_error = { $attr } had an error while reloading: { $exception }
Reload-deco_helper = Reloads the commands using all or command name.
Reload-deco_usage = How to use: { $prefix }reload (all) or (command_name)
Reload-deco_description = This command is used to reload all bot commands. If any have been updated and don't require a full restart.

# Reload Examples
Reload-cmd_ex1_args = commands
Reload-cmd_ex1_res = the commands have been successfully reloaded.
Reload-cmd_ex2_args = emotes
Reload-cmd_ex2_res = Emotes were successfully reloaded.
Reload-cmd_ex3_args = translations
Reload-cmd_ex3_res = TranslationManager were successfully reloaded.
